        "Description": "Famous artist Lucy Phillips and heiress Cornelia Stuyvesant have been implicated in the Utah Sands papers, detailing the funding given by the superrich to evangelical churches in order to hold a semblance of power over religion in much of the western world.\r\rThese two not only gave money to the church but helped bring more influence within to their associates within the  Elite. This funding threatens the very fabric of western society and it must be purged.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
